        SIOCGLIFPHYRTABLE _s_t_r_u_c_t _i_f_r_e_q _*
                Get the routing table the tunnel traffic operates in.

        SIOCSLIFPHYTTL _s_t_r_u_c_t _i_f_r_e_q _*
